<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56926" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρτομος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερτόμιος, κέρτομα
				βάζειν</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				788
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοροὶ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.83
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερτομίοισι</span>
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				7.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				5.54
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>mocking, delusive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					338
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1125
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					492.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμονία</span>, of Echo, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.191
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>).—Poet. word used once by <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i>, and in late Prose.</div>
